From 6b114eac3cd70f6cf4a8d96403ea3ee52d0abc34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Pignier <pignier.baptiste@tutanota.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:41:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] goodixtls53xd: Add driver for 27c6:538d using SIGFM

Driver and goodixtls helpers come from infinytum/libfprint (unstable
branch) with the capture fixes of the goodix53xd branch there. The driver
selects SIGFM since NBIS finds 1 or 2 minutiae on its 60x76 images.

Also pass -Wno-incompatible-pointer-types: GCC 14 rejects the legacy
goodixtls helpers otherwise.

Enroll works. Verification isn't reliable: on 21 test images, native size
rejects every genuine probe, x2 upscaling accepts 5/10 genuine but also
1/6 impostors, x3 accepts 9/10 genuine and 5/6 impostors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
